.page fortune 1 draw a random shrine fortune slip

# SYNOPSIS
*fortune* [*-ak*]

# DESCRIPTION
`fortune` is omikuji(1) with `-r`: every call draws a fresh slip at random, where `omikuji` gives the same slip all day. Output is boxed and coloured on a terminal and plain text in a pipe.

# OPTIONS
@ *-a*
    Plain ASCII, no box drawing.
@ *-k*
    Add the kanji for the rank and for the headings (for terminals whose font has them).

# SEE ALSO
omikuji(1)
